        109.57817077636719,
        532.726318359375,
        120.71064758300781
      ],
      "text": "This response clearly presents the data from the bar graph. The candidate presents\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        96.494140625,
        123.64342498779297,
        512.4952392578125,
        132.4839324951172
      ],
      "text": "all the data for 1968 first and then the data for 2018. There is an overview in the\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        96.16706848144531,
        137.70867919921875,
        493.7721252441406,
        148.5137176513672
      ],
      "text": "final sentence, but it should summarise the main changes from the bar chart\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        96.49417114257812,
        151.4468231201172,
        520.1135864257812,
        204.77503967285156
      ],
      "text": "rather than just saying that expenditure ‘had ... changed’. Information is arranged\ncoherently into four paragraphs, and there is clear overall progression. A range\nof cohesive devices is used [Turning to 2018\n| followed by\n| whereas] with an\nawareness of referencing [former one\n| the othe categories\n| Last three].\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        96.16706848144531,
        221.44598388671875,
        515.1708984375,
        302.250244140625
      ],
      "text": "There are some less common examples of vocabulary [dropped dramatically to\n|\nrised significantly|soared]. Errors remain [spent rates\n/ expenditure\n| housing\nspent/ housing costs] but do not impede communication. Similarly, grammatical\nstructures include some complex forms [had dropped ... to] and sentences with\nmultiple clauses; however, there are errors, including inconsistent use of articles\nand with past tenses.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        96.16703796386719,
        318.9214782714844,
        523.914306640625,
        372.2497253417969
      ],
      "text": "To improve the response,\na summary of the main trends from the bar chart is\nneeded in the overview; for example, the candidate could say that there has been\na significant decrease in spending on food over the 50-year period, but the cost of\nleisure, housing and transport has significantly increased.\n"
    },
